pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#F4F3ED"
notes: "跟 AI 说“第 4 页”很危险：页面一移动，第 4 页就换人了。所以每一页有一个四字 Slide ID，界面上显示在位置旁边；内部还有永久 page UUID。日常交流用 Slide ID 就够了。这样我们说的和改的是同一页，历史也才有地方挂。"
elements:
  - elementId: identity-title
    elementType: text
    role: title
    bounds:
        [48,40,560,40]
    content:
      text: "第 4 页会变，这一页不会"
      fontSize: 28
      fontFamily:
        ea: Microsoft YaHei
        latin: Arial
      color: "#17221C"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      align:
        - left
        - top
  - elementId: identity-lead
    elementType: text
    bounds:
        [48,86,760,30]
    content:
      text: "Position 是它在当前顺序里的位置；Slide ID 是它自己的四字编码。"
      fontSize: 14.5
      fontFamily:
        ea: Microsoft YaHei
        latin: Arial
      color: "#425048"
      align:
        - left
        - top
  - elementId: identity-panel
    elementType: shape
    bounds:
      - 42
      - 126
      - 876
      - 300
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF"
    border:
      color: "#D4DBD2"
      width: 0.8
      style: solid
  - elementId: identity-shot
    elementType: image
    bounds:
      - 48
      - 132
      - 864
      - 288
    src: media/imported/f5455f5cada808cb66355a623d9d2e07d5e8645a0e4cdd0ecc97220c7ab96bd5.png
    sourceName: zh-CN-native-outline-reading-4x.png
